(While I was debating what to eat in front of the menu...)
???: Wait, isn't that {name()}?
<<show pyo_smile>>
(I hear my name and turn around to see EunPyo.)
<<choice 주1_월_2교시_식당_서은표_긍1_영문 "Of course I remember you. Hey, EunPyo." 주1_월_2교시_식당_서은표_부1_영문 "Uh... did we meet at the kick-off party?">>
<<show pyo_idle>>
