title: 주1_월_2교시_식당_서은표_긍2_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +5>>
{name()}: Sure, that'd be nice.
{name()}: Did you find a spot? I put my bag over there, so you can leave yours next to mine.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Got it! I'll be right back.
EunPyo: Think about what you want to eat.
(EunPyo quickly placed her bag in the seat next to me.)
(We talked while eating together.)
(She's a cheerful guy. I feel like we've gotten a bit closer.)
<<end>>
